    {
      "id": "trace-facts-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 110,
      "y": 1535,
      "width": 1181.25,
      "height": 90,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "strokeColor": "#22c55e",
      "text": "1 coordinator + 2 specialist roots; 4 MCP tools; 9 generations; 771 native spans including transport/SDK work.\n771 spans are not 771 agent calls. Proxy agent identity remained unknown; no invented per-request identity join.\nActor configuration disables message capture; only the exact private trace route bypasses model selection.\nOriginal trace warnings remain evidence. Model timing differs from complete agent latency.",
